#* IntelliJ's internal file-template resource format (FileTemplateManager); it can contain
   Velocity macros such as ${NAME}, ${USER} or ${DATE}. This one is deliberately left without
   any — new Typst files are created blank by design, with starter content left to live
   templates instead. Velocity comment blocks like this one are stripped from the rendered
   output, so the created .typ file still ends up empty. *#